OL,3,GNEWSACould drug testing at gigs work?
OL,4,
OL,5,FBars, chip vans and portaloos are all
OL,6,Fcommon sights at classic outdoor gigs
OL,7,Fin Northern Ireland.
OL,9,FBut in the rest of the UK and the
OL,10,FRepublic of Ireland, some also have
OL,11,Fdedicated facilities that allow for the
OL,12,Frapid testing and identification of
OL,13,Fharmful drugs and substances.
OL,15,FPolice this week warned about the
OL,16,F"serious, potentially life-changing,
OL,17,Frisks of taking or supplying illegal
OL,18,Fdrugs" at outdoor music events.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
